As of 28-Jan-1996 we are releasing all code in this archive to the
public domain.  You may do with it as you wish.  There may be many
peices missing, these we do not have anymore.  You will have to try and
fill in the spaces yourself.

Anyone may do what they like with these programs and code, but we take
no reponsibility for anything that may happen due to the release of this
archive.

Some of the programs included use keyfiles.  The keyfile maker is also
included in this archive.  Or you could simply remove the routines from
the code.


Have fun...


Dave Dustin                     Renze de Ruiter
